---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Weak Airflow | AC Repair Wake Forest NC" description="Weak or low airflow from your AC vents in Wake Forest and Rolesville.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Weak Airflow</h1>
      <p>Weak or low airflow from your AC vents in Wake Forest and Rolesville.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Weak airflow reduces comfort and can cause the system to freeze or overheat. Causes include dirty filters, blocked returns, failing blower motors, collapsed ducts, or a dirty evaporator coil.</p>
      <p>We diagnose the restriction, restore proper CFM, and explain any duct or filter upgrades that will improve long-term performance.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Don't wait in the heat. Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day diagnosis and repair in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and surrounding areas.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>